name: The Eye — no repeat hands
author: corpus
description: >-
  The Eye prevents repeating a hand type this round. Ante 3 boss: have multiple viable hand
  types or use Luchador/Chicot.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - boss: TheEye
    antes: [3]
should:
  - joker: Luchador
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Chicot
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: SmearedJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
